WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.528
Coby: Come on, Mark!

2
00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:10.233
Play with us.

3
00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.752
Daisy: Yeah, we're having fun.

4
00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:14.991
Mark: No, thanks.

5
00:00:14.992 --> 00:00:18.330
Jenna: What's wrong, Mark?

6
00:00:18.331 --> 00:00:20.783
Coby: Is it about tug-of-war?

7
00:00:20.784 --> 00:00:24.538
Coby: That was mean of Kara to get you in trouble.

8
00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:28.199
Mark: No. It's not about that.

9
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.802
It's about something worse.

10
00:00:30.803 --> 00:00:35.875
Mark: Much worse. I did something terrible.

11
00:00:35.876 --> 00:00:38.175
Coby: What did you do?

12
00:00:38.176 --> 00:00:41.619
Mark: I wrote a mean letter about Miss Gray.

13
00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.962
Jenna: What?

14
00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:48.100
Daisy: Mark! How could you do that?

15
00:00:48.101 --> 00:00:50.222
Mark: I didn't mean it.

16
00:00:50.223 --> 00:00:53.430
I was just mad about tug-of-war.

17
00:00:53.431 --> 00:00:55.535
Mark: So I started writing and . . .

18
00:00:55.536 --> 00:00:58.394
I made a big mistake!

19
00:00:58.395 --> 00:01:02.090
Mark: I wish I could get my letter back!

20
00:01:02.091 --> 00:01:04.715
Jenna: Maybe you can write a new letter.

21
00:01:04.716 --> 00:01:06.124
Daisy: Yeah!

22
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:11.527
Coby: And ask Miss Gray to give back the old one.

23
00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:13.799
Mark: I don't know.

24
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.036
She's probably really mad at me.

25
00:01:17.037 --> 00:01:32.094
Jenna: It's still worth a try.

26
00:01:32.095 --> 00:01:35.093
Mark: Excuse me? Miss Gray?

27
00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:36.670
Miss Gray: Good morning, Mark.

28
00:01:36.671 --> 00:01:40.739
You're early today.

29
00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.808
Mark: I brought you something.

30
00:01:42.809 --> 00:01:46.595
Mark: It's a new letter because my first letter—

31
00:01:46.596 --> 00:01:51.291
Miss Gray: Went right in the trash.

32
00:01:51.292 --> 00:01:59.774
You didn't mean it.

33
00:01:59.775 --> 00:02:03.559
Mark: I wrote a new letter.

34
00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.170
Mark: Dear Room Two Kids,

35
00:02:06.171 --> 00:02:09.193
You're going to love second grade.

36
00:02:09.194 --> 00:02:11.307
It's lots of fun.

37
00:02:11.308 --> 00:02:17.110
Mark: And you will learn about stars . . . and plants . . . and manners.

38
00:02:17.111 --> 00:02:19.644
John: And you will learn something else.

39
00:02:19.645 --> 00:02:45.031
John: Miss Gray is the best teacher in the whole wide world!

